## 10. Anti-patterns

- ❌ Modifying schema without a migration.
- ❌ String-typed status fields without an enum.
- ❌ Foreign keys without `ON DELETE` policy.
- ❌ Unbounded text columns where a finite enum was possible.
- ❌ Storing PII without considering retention.
- ❌ Storing secrets in DB cells.
